{"ref":"BDB, מֶ֫כֶר","hw":"מֶ֫כֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מֶ֫כֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.10\">Pr 31:10</a></sup> <strong>merchandise, value</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.16\">Ne 13:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְרָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.10\">Pr 31:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְרָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:19\" href=\"/Numbers.20.19\">Nu 20:19</a>; prob. also <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכָּרָיו</span> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְּכָרָיו</span>) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a>, v. Di Dr;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>merchandise</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.16\">Ne 13:16</a>;<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>value, price</em>, of water <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:19\" href=\"/Numbers.20.19\">Nu 20:19</a> (JE), cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a> (v. supr.); of capable woman <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.10\">Pr 31:10</a>.","next":"BDB, מָכִיר","prev":"BDB, מָכַר"}